---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const repo = 'https://github.com/jonathanperis/blazor-mudblazor-starter';
---

<footer class="colophon">
  <div>
    <p class="colophon-mark">Blazor learning sandbox</p>
    <p>A school project for Blazor and MudBlazor: labs that explain behavior, a gallery of working components, and whole pages composed from them.</p>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Read</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={`${base}/docs/getting-started/`}>Getting started</a></li>
      <li><a href={`${base}/docs/learning-path/`}>Learning paths</a></li>
      <li><a href={`${base}/demo/`}>Live demo</a></li>
      <li><a href={repo} rel="noopener noreferrer">Source on GitHub</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2>Colophon</h2>
    <p>Set in Fraunces and IBM Plex, served from this site. Built with Astro and .NET 10; the demo is Blazor WebAssembly on GitHub Pages.</p>
    <p>MIT licensed. Made by <a href="https://github.com/jonathanperis" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jonathan Peris</a>. <a href={`${base}/fonts/OFL-Fraunces.txt`}>Font licenses</a>.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
